{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "schinese", "appid": 924970, "month": "2023-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1675209600, "end_date": 1675900799, "month_true_total": 284, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:05:23 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "132406936", "author": {"steamid": "76561199393635627", "personaname": "初恋学长", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199393635627/", "num_games_owned": 35, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 1524, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 765, "last_played": 1776993887, "avatar": "1c8154718bd7d17ab7d169879aa1fe6a4a6fd8c9"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "说句老实话，喋血复仇并没有很吸引我，虽然他的画质精美，射击手感很棒，但是就是没有生化危机带给我那种喜悦，不论他再怎么画质高，枪再多，也不好玩，感觉这个游戏已经完全脱离了丧尸题材的恐怖和乐趣，更像是贴了mod的fps射击游戏，所以第一原价买还是半价买都是大冤种，史低可以玩玩，不过融入的卡牌系统本人不是很喜欢，本来就是快餐式游戏，靠一手集齐卡牌是留不住玩家的，我相信更多的人都是唾弃的，希望开发者再次开发游戏的时候多重视剧情的发展和小彩蛋之类的活动，最好在学学生化危机，弄得吓人一点，解密出一些，不要无脑堆画质，卡牌抽卡，你又不是原神，靠肝恶心人大多数玩家不会买你账的，价格又贵，希望你们多参考生化危机，别学肉鸡套路了，太几把拉夸了，玩十几个小时就不想玩了，还集齐个毛", "timestamp_created": 1675835149, "timestamp_updated": 1675835149, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.539421617984771729", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "132382012", "author": {"steamid": "76561198810918462", "personaname": "XiaoQing", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198810918462/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1695, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1665, "last_played": 1740582073, "avatar": "b8a6f62b8b7bd48279016ddb5616f9a555b0cf5d"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "组一套近战卡牌乱砍过关，但是还是打折吧·", "timestamp_created": 1675792472, "timestamp_updated": 1675792472, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "132370423", "author": {"steamid": "76561198159379013", "personaname": "孢子游侠", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198159379013/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 34268, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 34113, "last_played": 1697114177, "avatar": "d7114c96eb1c240320ccda745d2cc04249da04ba"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "给龟爷跪下了，求求来个反转继续更新吧，一年更一次也行啊", "timestamp_created": 1675777164, "timestamp_updated": 1675777164, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523526430130004883", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 2}]}, {"recommendationid": "132365730", "author": {"steamid": "76561198340560981", "personaname": "Mayning", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Raidy2333/", "num_games_owned": 196, "num_reviews": 47, "playtime_forever": 10851, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10062, "last_played": 1738332545, "avatar": "8ecf7dbda64061330461f0c081aaf1b7b27b2ab8"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "随着龟岩宣布喋血不再更新，我想也是时候给它一个结论了。\n\n整体来说，个人认为喋血不必活在“求生之路精神续作”的标签下面，它本身就是一款优秀的合作游戏。\n\n弱智的AI，阴间的刷怪模式，拉胯的动作细节，甚至是刚发售之时无法正常推进的阴间难度……如果没有这些本可以做得更好的地方，我甚至会认为它超越了求生之路。不过很可惜，龟岩的这款喋血有太多不尽人意的地方。\n\n做得好的地方就不一一赘述了，喋血复仇最大的亮点就是引入肉鸽like的卡组系统以及随机因素的腐败卡事件，这是喋血游戏性本源所在。玩家通过卡组，可以有相当多的BUILD思路，每个玩家对于每个角色或者是武器的理解是不一样的，而我个人觉得最有意思的事情就是在和朋友不断地开黑中调整自己的思路，改进自己的卡组。我没有去看过其他人的攻略或是卡组，所有的搭配都来源于自己的理解和在实战中的经验。同样的，和开黑队友交流卡组和打法心得也是我认为非常有意思的地方。\n\n龟岩停止更新喋血确实挺可惜的，即使开放创意工坊，喋血本身的制作难度就很大，不可能像求生2那样私人MOD百花齐放。就像靠MOD为核心的骑砍2一样，玩家个人的用爱发电很难延续下去。如果你喜欢思考属于自己的卡牌搭配，喜欢和朋友们一起开黑揍僵尸，即使停止更新，打折时喋血也是你不错的选择（野队环境参差不齐，建议固定队开黑）游戏自发售以来随着更新变得相对稳定成熟，不再有当初为了买卡组刷一天蠕虫先锋的枯燥，难度也不会有初期那么阴间。\n\n如果真要说有什么精神续作的地方的话，我想一定是四个队友背靠着背，一路欢声笑语——一如当初在网吧玩着求生之路的我们。", "timestamp_created": 1675769771, "timestamp_updated": 1675769771, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.507894754409790039", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "132339821", "author": {"steamid": "76561198306145419", "personaname": "円谷のくうそう とくさ", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198306145419/", "num_games_owned": 425, "num_reviews": 161, "playtime_forever": 79846, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 51596, "last_played": 1731176756, "avatar": "8ed819fdcf0acaf5061f135a5aa42deb39ac5837"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "妈的，龟岛工作室真畜生，说不更就不更了，这是骗够钱了又搞新的接着骗喽，还找这种人手不足狗屁理由，特么人手不足，好开发新的游戏明显编都不会编故事，而且也不开放创意工坊让玩家自己给这游戏多姿多彩mod，官方是一点不做人呀，诚心让玩家坐牢游戏体验....", "timestamp_created": 1675720260, "timestamp_updated": 1675720260, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.51443016529083252", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "132339136", "author": {"steamid": "76561198227898644", "personaname": "警长是只奶牛妙", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/maohaohao/", "num_games_owned": 48, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 10063, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10032, "last_played": 1675730404, "avatar": "8b84adbdb97b0f57819150d36cc300715d8ba5c5"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "总的来说还是好玩的", "timestamp_created": 1675719136, "timestamp_updated": 1675719136, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517075121402740479", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}